---

<div
    class="w-full text-white flex flex-col bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat"
    style="background-image:url('images/03_Image_BG_02.webp');background-position-y: 0rem;background-color:#060103;background-attachment: fixed;"
>
    <div
        class="bg-[#00000094] flex justify-center backdrop-blur-xl[z-index:100] border-b-black border-b"
    >
        <div
            class="flex flex-col md:flex-row max-w-[2000px]"
        >
            <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 pl-2">
                <img
                    class="relative inline-block my-4 md:my-0 [top:-100px] md:[top:-40px] px-12 md:px-20"
                    src="images/03_Image_Still_01.webp"
                    alt=""
                />
                <img
                    class="relative inline-block md:[top:auto] [top:-50px] md:[bottom:-40px] px-12 md:px-20"
                    src="images/03_Image_Still_02.webp"
                    alt=""
                />
            </div>
            <div
                class="w-full md:w-1/2 md:pl-2 md:pt-[140px] pb-10 px-[10%] md:pr-[10%] xl:pl-12"
            >
                <p class="font-light py-4 text-3xl text-[#cb8337] mb-4">
                    Heating and ventilation ensure that comfort endures all year
                    round.
                </p>
                <p class="font-light py-4">
                    The cabin layout, highlighted by the wide dashboard, extends
                    with continuous lines into the door trims, enhancing the
                    sense of space.
                </p>
                <p class="font-light py-4">
                    Materials such as genuine maple wood and high-quality woven
                    textiles are raised by the asymmetrical balance of Hacho –
                    or broken rhythm, adding depth and charm.
                </p>
                <p class="font-light py-4">
                    The careful selection of textures and materials all come
                    together to give you this sense of calm, with a connection
                    every time you slide into the driver's seat, while the
                    ambient lighting surrounds the cabin at night.
                </p>
                <p class="font-light py-4">
                    The Mazda CX-90 demonstrates the truly special Takumi
                    Package, with Pure White nappa leather trim, white maple
                    wood finishes, and the intricate cloth dashboard panel with
                    Kakenui stitching.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div
        class="w-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-center mt-20 pb-[8rem] pl-[8.4%] pr-[9%]"
    >
        <div
            class="max-w-[1400px] xl:max-w-[2000px] flex flex-col lg:flex-row"
        >
            <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 px-0 py-[4rem]">
                <div class="w-full">
                    <div
                        class="max-w-xl pt-7 pb-7 border-t-2 border-[#cc873f] text-left"
                    >
                        <p class="text-3xl font-light text-gray-800">
                            “Mazda has moved the game forward with a design
                            that's all about supporting you, literally, from
                            every angle.”
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-row max-w-xl mb-12 justify-between">
                        <div
                            class="border-b-2 border-[#cc873f] mr-1"
                            style="width:-webkit-fill-available;"
                        >
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="py-4 text-black font-light lg:pr-[14rem]">
                    The heated and ventilated Captain’s seats in the second row
                    make the experience every bit as special for your passengers
                    too.
                </p>
                <p class="py-4 text-black font-light lg:pr-[14rem]">
                    Practical and spacious, the boots in the Mazda CX-60 and
                    Mazda CX-90 are about making every journey as convenient as
                    possible.
                </p>
                <p class="py-4 text-black font-light lg:pr-[14rem]">
                    A simple swipe of your foot under the bumper, and access to
                    the boot is completely hands-free.
                </p>
                <p class="py-4 text-black font-light lg:pr-[14rem]">
                    All Mazda CX-60 and Mazda CX-90 models include a handy
                    150-watt AC power outlet, perfect for fast-charging a laptop
                    or other devices on long road trips.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 relative lg:pl-[7%]">
                <div class="lg:absolute top-[0rem] flex flex-col gap-8">
                    <img src="images/03_Image_Still_03.webp" alt="" />
                    <img src="images/03_Image_Still_04.webp" alt="" />
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    @media (min-width: 2000px) {
        /* Your styles for screens above 2000px width */
        content-still-2-left {
            padding-left: 10rem;
            padding-right: 10rem;
        }
    }
</style>
